    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h1><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">View Sale Orders</span></h1><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"note\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"6d9657c1-e9b9-4281-a9b5-86ef81389e24\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>The Orders/Quotations that appear in ERP as shown below have to first be ordered by the provider using <ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Order Medications and/or Tests\" ri:version-at-save=\"3\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[these steps]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link>.</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">In ERP application (Odoo or OpenERP) go to &ldquo;Sales&rdquo; from the top menu,&nbsp;and &ldquo;Quotations&rdquo; from the left panel.</span></p><p><br /></p><p><ac:image ac:height=\"250\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Odoo_Customer_Quotations_list.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">(<span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">For the above to appear on ERP side,&nbsp;<code>bahmni-erp-connect</code> service needs to be running and the OpenMRS to ERP sync is functional).</span></span></p><h1><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Add Discounts or Pay in&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Instalments</span></h1><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Select a quotation for a patient, and then click on &ldquo;Edit&rdquo; &nbsp;to add or modify the contents of the bill as in screenshot below.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"e1769381-b87f-4858-a616-456a8f506019\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Discount on Order lines</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>From Bahmni 0.92 onwards, ERP functions are handled by Odoo 10, where you can even mention discount at line level. See&nbsp;<ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Odoo Sales Configuration\" ri:version-at-save=\"10\" /></ac:link> for more info</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">The quotations can also be edited to accommodate discounts.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:image><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Odoo_Customer_Quotation_Fixed_Discount.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></span></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">See below for OpenERP7 specific view.&nbsp;</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"expand\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"e72900e6-603f-4a1f-916e-3935bfb58d0e\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">OpenERP7 View</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:image ac:width=\"800\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screen Shot 2017-06-18 at 11.06.49 PM.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><h1><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Confirm Order</span></h1><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Select the quotation, click on &ldquo;Confirm Sale&rdquo; to proceed towards payment.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Once the order is Confirmed edits are no longer possible.&nbsp;</span></p><p>Once sale is confirmed, a delivery order (for any stockable line item) will be created. You can then create invoice and register payment.&nbsp;</p><p><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"edcd5e42-a651-42fa-b315-aa0c7dc61150\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Odoo 10</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Bahmni Odoo extensions (for v0.92) provide several enhancements to provide &quot;Auto confirmation of Delivery&quot;, &quot;Skipping Invoice Options&quot;, &quot;Determination of Sale Price based on purchase price markups&quot; etc.&nbsp; Please refer to the <ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Odoo Sales Configuration\" ri:version-at-save=\"10\" /></ac:link> page for more details on such options.&nbsp;</span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><p><ac:image><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Odoo_Register_Invoice_Payment.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">See below for OpenERP7 specific view.&nbsp;</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"expand\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"886c7a08-7f4e-4bbc-bd0a-a5a9edf674ae\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">OpenERP7 View</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:image ac:width=\"800\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screen Shot 2017-06-18 at 11.08.00 PM.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"c49ef8f6-d049-4523-ad61-2c58ae344208\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">On this Page</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"63f57144-d1b5-4e7c-9ddf-7a2eecd53a78\" /></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"600d29bf-fc08-48b0-8dfa-c9a5e4f20526\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#1FA5A0</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Related Links</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Print Bill and Prescription\" ri:version-at-save=\"4\" /></ac:link></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Feature Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Patient Billing and Accounting\" ri:version-at-save=\"9\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Billing and Accounting - Feature Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"55de8170-c071-4602-aacf-72d73bdf438e\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Implementation Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Accounting Configuration\" ri:version-at-save=\"12\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Billing and Accounting - Implementer's Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link>&nbsp;(OpenERP7)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Odoo Accounting Configuration\" ri:version-at-save=\"8\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Accounting Configuration - Implementer's Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link> (Odoo)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Odoo Sales Configuration\" ri:version-at-save=\"10\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Sales Configuration - Implementer's Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link> (Odoo)</span></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
