    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h1 id=\"ManageOrders-ViewSaleOrders\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">View Sale Orders</span></h1><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-note conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"6d9657c1-e9b9-4281-a9b5-86ef81389e24\" data-macro-name=\"note\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>The Orders/Quotations that appear in ERP as shown below have to first be ordered by the provider using <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/115217943/Order+Medications+and+or+Tests\" data-linked-resource-id=\"115217943\" data-linked-resource-version=\"6\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">these steps</a>.</p></div></div><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">In ERP application (Odoo or OpenERP) go to “Sales” from the top menu, and “Quotations” from the left panel.</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014614/Odoo_Customer_Quotations_list.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565782395752&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=900&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014614/Odoo_Customer_Quotations_list.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565782395752&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"907903091\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Odoo_Customer_Quotations_list.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014614\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"17\" data-media-id=\"2a9cefc9-12c5-4a40-b964-543eaf048037\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014614/Odoo_Customer_Quotations_list.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565782395752&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1800&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014614/Odoo_Customer_Quotations_list.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565782395752&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=900&amp;height=250 1x\"></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">(<span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">For the above to appear on ERP side, <code>bahmni-erp-connect</code> service needs to be running and the OpenMRS to ERP sync is functional).</span></span></p><h1 id=\"ManageOrders-AddDiscountsorPayinInstalments\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Add Discounts or Pay in </span><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Instalments</span></h1><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Select a quotation for a patient, and then click on “Edit”  to add or modify the contents of the bill as in screenshot below. </span></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e1769381-b87f-4858-a616-456a8f506019\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><p class=\"title\">Discount on Order lines</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>From Bahmni 0.92 onwards, ERP functions are handled by Odoo 10, where you can even mention discount at line level. See <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/900464675/Odoo+Sales+Configuration\" data-linked-resource-id=\"900464675\" data-linked-resource-version=\"18\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Odoo Sales Configuration</a> for more info</p></div></div><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">The quotations can also be edited to accommodate discounts.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left: 30.0px;\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014614/Odoo_Customer_Quotation_Fixed_Discount.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565786527744&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014614/Odoo_Customer_Quotation_Fixed_Discount.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565786527744&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"907935811\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Odoo_Customer_Quotation_Fixed_Discount.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014614\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"17\" data-media-id=\"338895df-fdf6-4cdd-9d36-cc430dda2145\" data-media-type=\"file\"></span></span></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">See below for OpenERP7 specific view. </p><div class=\"expand-container conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e72900e6-603f-4a1f-916e-3935bfb58d0e\" data-macro-name=\"expand\" id=\"expander-102206825\"><div id=\"expander-control-102206825\" class=\"expand-control\"><span class=\"expand-control-icon icon\"> </span><span class=\"expand-control-text\">OpenERP7 View</span></div><div id=\"expander-content-102206825\" class=\"expand-content expand-hidden\"><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014614/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.06.49%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497807816336&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=502\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014614/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.06.49%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497807816336&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"117308068\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-06-18 at 11.06.49 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014614\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"17\" data-media-id=\"730c7b77-a46c-469d-b0ac-ab85bf2ab327\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014614/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.06.49%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497807816336&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1600&amp;height=1004 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014614/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.06.49%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497807816336&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=502 1x\" /></span></p></div></div><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><h1 id=\"ManageOrders-ConfirmOrder\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Confirm Order</span></h1><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Select the quotation, click on “Confirm Sale” to proceed towards payment. </span><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Once the order is Confirmed edits are no longer possible. </span></p><p>Once sale is confirmed, a delivery order (for any stockable line item) will be created. You can then create invoice and register payment. </p><p><br/></p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"edcd5e42-a651-42fa-b315-aa0c7dc61150\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><p class=\"title\">Odoo 10</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Bahmni Odoo extensions (for v0.92) provide several enhancements to provide &quot;Auto confirmation of Delivery&quot;, &quot;Skipping Invoice Options&quot;, &quot;Determination of Sale Price based on purchase price markups&quot; etc.  Please refer to the <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/900464675/Odoo+Sales+Configuration\" data-linked-resource-id=\"900464675\" data-linked-resource-version=\"18\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Odoo Sales Configuration</a> page for more details on such options. </span></p></div></div><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014614/Odoo_Register_Invoice_Payment.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565787121023&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014614/Odoo_Register_Invoice_Payment.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1565787121023&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"907968680\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Odoo_Register_Invoice_Payment.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014614\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"17\" data-media-id=\"81c23481-9394-47d1-8a63-6526f1d82fe2\" data-media-type=\"file\"></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">See below for OpenERP7 specific view. </p><div class=\"expand-container conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"886c7a08-7f4e-4bbc-bd0a-a5a9edf674ae\" data-macro-name=\"expand\" id=\"expander-605337192\"><div id=\"expander-control-605337192\" class=\"expand-control\"><span class=\"expand-control-icon icon\"> </span><span class=\"expand-control-text\">OpenERP7 View</span></div><div id=\"expander-content-605337192\" class=\"expand-content expand-hidden\"><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014614/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.08.00%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497807817320&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=479\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014614/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.08.00%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497807817320&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"117308079\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-06-18 at 11.08.00 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014614\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"17\" data-media-id=\"8d36b37f-81d6-497f-b386-f26813c3b709\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014614/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.08.00%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497807817320&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1600&amp;height=958 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014614/Screen%20Shot%202017-06-18%20at%2011.08.00%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1497807817320&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=800&amp;height=479 1x\" /></span></p></div></div><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"c49ef8f6-d049-4523-ad61-2c58ae344208\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"63f57144-d1b5-4e7c-9ddf-7a2eecd53a78\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"600d29bf-fc08-48b0-8dfa-c9a5e4f20526\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: white;\"><b>Related Links</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32014612/Print+Bill+and+Prescription\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32014612\" data-linked-resource-version=\"7\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Print Bill and Prescription</a></p>\n</div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/32604217/Patient+Billing+and+Accounting\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32604217\" data-linked-resource-version=\"10\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Billing and Accounting - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div><d